('advanced-native-1268', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1268-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The custom option seemed very expensive, so a standard frame was being considered."],"options":["The drawing was no longer worth protecting because the quote was high.","The standard frame had been tested and found unsuitable before the question.","The custom option seemed very expensive, so a standard frame was being considered.","The custom frame had already been ordered and paid for."]},"advanced-native-1268-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I wanted to see whether a less expensive option could still protect the drawing.","The custom quote was much higher than I wanted to commit to immediately.","I had not agreed to order and wanted to compare the available choices.","The custom one would cost an arm and a leg."],"options":["I wanted to see whether a less expensive option could still protect the drawing.","The custom quote was much higher than I wanted to commit to immediately.","I had not agreed to order and wanted to compare the available choices.","The custom one would cost an arm and a leg."]},"advanced-native-1268-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["It would cost her an arm and a leg, so she wants to borrow it before considering a purchase."],"options":["She has already paid for it because she stopped considering the cost.","It would cost her an arm and a leg, so she wants to borrow it before considering a purchase.","The high price proves that the illustrations have no value to her."]},"advanced-native-1268-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["存在一個由片語指定的精確金額。"],"options":["存在一個由片語指定的精確金額。","說話者可能想比較較便宜的選項。","說話者覺得費用很高。"]},"advanced-native-1268-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I care about the drawing; I just do not want a frame that costs an arm and a leg before checking the standard options."],"options":["I care about the drawing; I just do not want a frame that costs an arm and a leg before checking the standard options.","Yes, an expensive frame means the drawing itself no longer matters to me.","I have ordered the custom frame already, so there is no choice left to discuss."]},"advanced-native-1268-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["It could cost an arm and a leg, and I appreciate your offer, but please do not commit yet. I want to ask which repairs the clock needs and which changes are only cosmetic before we decide together.","Restoring every part would cost an arm and a leg, so I would like a clearer breakdown before accepting your help. Could we separate the necessary repairs from the cosmetic work first?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1269', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1269-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["That evening’s work ended, with the fourth box left for the next day."],"options":["The group decided to continue labelling through the night.","That evening’s work ended, with the fourth box left for the next day.","The entire archive was complete before the team left.","The fourth box was rejected and would never be examined."]},"advanced-native-1269-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We called it a day and noted what remained for tomorrow.","We stopped that evening with one box still on the plan.","The next day’s work was written down before we left.","We ended the session without treating the whole archive as finished."],"options":["We called it a day and noted what remained for tomorrow.","We stopped that evening with one box still on the plan.","The next day’s work was written down before we left.","We ended the session without treating the whole archive as finished."]},"advanced-native-1269-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Finishing the welcome task was not calling it a day; she continued working on the photographs."],"options":["She called it a day as soon as the welcome task ended and left before the photographs were sorted.","Sorting photographs was part of the welcome task, so the group never began a different job.","Finishing the welcome task was not calling it a day; she continued working on the photographs."]},"advanced-native-1269-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["整個計劃已完成，沒有任何後續工作。"],"options":["說話者想暫時停下來。","目前這一節活動結束。","整個計劃已完成，沒有任何後續工作。"]},"advanced-native-1269-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We called it a day; we did not finish the whole archive, and the fourth box is still tomorrow’s task."],"options":["We decided never to open the fourth box, so there is no task for tomorrow.","We called it a day; we did not finish the whole archive, and the fourth box is still tomorrow’s task.","Yes, ending the session is enough to mark the unchecked box as complete."]},"advanced-native-1269-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Let us call it a day before the disagreement becomes more personal. We can each bring one passage tomorrow and compare what it supports, rather than ask either person to concede tonight.","I would like us to call it a day and return to the character with a passage each. Pausing does not mean one of us has won; it gives us a clearer starting point for tomorrow."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1270', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1270-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The paragraph count, while identifying a quotation’s source remained required."],"options":["The publication date, which the editor explicitly changed.","The paragraph count, while identifying a quotation’s source remained required.","All requirements, including giving a quotation’s source.","Only the source name, while three paragraphs were compulsory."]},"advanced-native-1270-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Three paragraphs was not a hard-and-fast rule.","The editor treated length as guidance rather than an exact compulsory count.","Clarity could be achieved without using exactly three paragraphs.","A shorter letter could fit the stated guidance while still giving quotation sources."],"options":["Three paragraphs was not a hard-and-fast rule.","The editor treated length as guidance rather than an exact compulsory count.","Clarity could be achieved without using exactly three paragraphs.","A shorter letter could fit the stated guidance while still giving quotation sources."]},"advanced-native-1270-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["For this issue, one piece is a hard-and-fast rule; an exception in another competition does not change the editor’s stated limit."],"options":["For this issue, one piece is a hard-and-fast rule; an exception in another competition does not change the editor’s stated limit.","The earlier competition’s exception means this editor has also invited a second piece.","The editor has described one piece only as a flexible suggestion and has accepted extra submissions."]},"advanced-native-1270-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有其他明確要求也一律失效。"],"options":["這項指引可按情況調整。","這項指引不要求每次都精確照做。","所有其他明確要求也一律失效。"]},"advanced-native-1270-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The length is not a hard-and-fast rule, but that does not remove the separate requirement to name the source."],"options":["Three paragraphs are compulsory, and source names are merely an optional length guide.","The length is not a hard-and-fast rule, but that does not remove the separate requirement to name the source.","Yes, flexibility about length applies to every requirement on the page."]},"advanced-native-1270-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Our usual seating is not a hard-and-fast rule, and Grandma has only asked to be near the window. Could we keep that place for her and let the others choose where they sit?","I would not turn an old habit into a hard-and-fast rule for everyone. Let us respect Grandma’s window preference without saying she has ordered the whole seating plan."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1271', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1271-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The team’s extensive preparation, rather than a guarantee about every response."],"options":["Proof that every reader had already enjoyed the visit.","The readers’ questions were left until after the visit, while preparation focused only on the room.","The team’s extensive preparation, rather than a guarantee about every response.","A decision to remove all questions and recording arrangements."]},"advanced-native-1271-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They checked the setting, equipment and the readers’ questions.","They put considerable work into making the visit work for the people involved.","Their preparation covered practical needs as well as the conversation.","They pulled out all the stops to arrange a thoughtful welcome."],"options":["They checked the setting, equipment and the readers’ questions.","They put considerable work into making the visit work for the people involved.","Their preparation covered practical needs as well as the conversation.","They pulled out all the stops to arrange a thoughtful welcome."]},"advanced-native-1271-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They pulled out all the stops, but the result was not theirs to guarantee."],"options":["Their practice meant the judges were obliged to award them the win.","They pulled out all the stops, but the result was not theirs to guarantee.","Losing the vote proves that they made no serious preparations."]},"advanced-native-1271-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["結果必定成功，而且不用顧及任何規則。"],"options":["結果必定成功，而且不用顧及任何規則。","盡可能付出努力。","嘗試運用可用資源。"]},"advanced-native-1271-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We pulled out all the stops in our preparation; we can still learn from losing without pretending that work never happened."],"options":["I would judge our preparation only by the final score rather than the research and practice we did.","Our practice means we deserved the vote more than the other team, even without examining their arguments.","We pulled out all the stops in our preparation; we can still learn from losing without pretending that work never happened."]},"advanced-native-1271-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["She pulled out all the stops to finish our recordings, rearranging interviews and checking transcripts. I can recommend her careful preparation, but I cannot promise that she will be available for unlimited hours.","In our recording project, she pulled out all the stops to help us deliver the work. That is evidence of the effort I observed, not a promise about every future task or working hour."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1272', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1272-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Responding to callers live, despite knowing the books and rehearsing the opening."],"options":["How to begin the programme, because the opening had not been rehearsed.","Which books the team would discuss, because no titles had been chosen yet.","Whether the team would allow any rehearsal before the programme.","Responding to callers live, despite knowing the books and rehearsing the opening."]},"advanced-native-1272-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Knowing the books did not let me predict how each conversation would develop.","Rehearsal prepared the opening, while the callers’ questions remained open.","I was stepping into the unknown when I began answering callers on air.","I had not experienced a live exchange with the callers before."],"options":["Knowing the books did not let me predict how each conversation would develop.","Rehearsal prepared the opening, while the callers’ questions remained open.","I was stepping into the unknown when I began answering callers on air.","I had not experienced a live exchange with the callers before."]},"advanced-native-1272-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She was stepping into the unknown at the start, but the later account describes familiarity rather than unchanged uncertainty."],"options":["The later passage introduces an unfamiliar new assignment rather than confidence with the same routine.","She was stepping into the unknown at the start, but the later account describes familiarity rather than unchanged uncertainty.","Her later confidence proves that she never felt uncertain on the first day."]},"advanced-native-1272-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["必定完全沒有準備，而且結果一定不好。"],"options":["開始一項不熟悉的經驗。","不確定經驗將如何發展。","必定完全沒有準備，而且結果一定不好。"]},"advanced-native-1272-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am stepping into the unknown with the callers, but rehearsing the opening still gives me something useful to begin with."],"options":["I already know every caller’s question, so the whole programme will follow a fixed script.","I am stepping into the unknown with the callers, but rehearsing the opening still gives me something useful to begin with.","Yes, the rehearsal has given me no preparation because I cannot predict every caller."]},"advanced-native-1272-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["With her grandfather’s notes in her bag, Lena is stepping into the unknown on the island where the painter once lived. The pages tell her where to begin, but not who will answer when she knocks.","Lena steps into the unknown with a notebook that offers a starting point rather than an ending. On the island, every name she follows may open a different part of the painter’s story."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1274', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1274-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Responsibility for the photograph selection personally made."],"options":["A reader’s claim that the photographs had already been removed.","Responsibility for the photograph selection personally made.","A committee decision the speaker had not taken part in.","A rule forbidding the speaker from asking anyone for advice."]},"advanced-native-1274-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I had no one to hide behind because the selection was my own decision.","I was the only person who had made the selection.","That explanation would transfer my decision to people who had not made it.","I needed to explain my own reasons rather than invent a group decision."],"options":["I had no one to hide behind because the selection was my own decision.","I was the only person who had made the selection.","That explanation would transfer my decision to people who had not made it.","I needed to explain my own reasons rather than invent a group decision."]},"advanced-native-1274-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Saying she has “no one to hide behind” does not make a joint choice her decision alone; each editor should explain their part."],"options":["Because the decision was shared, none of the editors needs to explain any part of the choice.","Saying she has “no one to hide behind” does not make a joint choice her decision alone; each editor should explain their part.","The person presenting the cover made the selection alone, while the other editors had no part in it."]},"advanced-native-1274-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["本人永遠不能向任何人請教。"],"options":["本人可能需要直接解釋自己的決定。","沒有其他人可替自己遮擋那項責任。","本人永遠不能向任何人請教。"]},"advanced-native-1274-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I have no one to hide behind for the selection, but asking for advice can help me explain or improve my own decision."],"options":["If I ask for advice now, I can say the adviser originally chose the photographs.","I have no one to hide behind for the selection, but asking for advice can help me explain or improve my own decision.","Yes, responsibility means I must refuse every offer of advice."]},"advanced-native-1274-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I have no one to hide behind here: the wrong caption was in my own draft, not a choice made by the layout editor. I am sorry for blaming her, and I will correct both the caption and my earlier reply.","I had no one to hide behind when I wrote that caption, and checking the draft shows the mistake was mine. I withdraw my claim about the layout editor and will publish the corrected caption."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1275', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1275-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The examples changed in response to the children, while the learning aim stayed the same."],"options":["The children’s questions were ignored so that every example remained fixed.","The aim changed to memorising facts rather than describing visible details.","The examples changed in response to the children, while the learning aim stayed the same.","There had been no questions or aim prepared before the walk."]},"advanced-native-1275-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their questions drew our attention to details we had not planned to discuss.","We kept the descriptive aim but chose examples that connected with what they noticed.","The activity gave us information that helped reshape the explanation.","We adapted as we went in response to the children’s observations."],"options":["Their questions drew our attention to details we had not planned to discuss.","We kept the descriptive aim but chose examples that connected with what they noticed.","The activity gave us information that helped reshape the explanation.","We adapted as we went in response to the children’s observations."]},"advanced-native-1275-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They adapt as they go, using each round’s feedback without abandoning the test’s purpose."],"options":["They began with no plan and changed the purpose after every unrelated suggestion.","They decided the first version could never be changed, regardless of the repeated confusion.","They adapt as they go, using each round’s feedback without abandoning the test’s purpose."]},"advanced-native-1275-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["開始前一定完全沒有計劃或目標。"],"options":["在進行中回應新情況。","按學到的資訊調整方法。","開始前一定完全沒有計劃或目標。"]},"advanced-native-1275-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We had a plan, but we adapted as we went so the examples responded to what the children noticed."],"options":["Yes, changing an example means there could not have been 