('advanced-native-1296', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1296-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Listening and helping the speaker feel steady enough to identify a next step."],"options":["Offering only removal equipment and avoiding any conversation about the change.","Listening and helping the speaker feel steady enough to identify a next step.","Making the final housing choice without involving the speaker.","Assuring the speaker that every plan would remain unchanged."]},"advanced-native-1296-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She was an emotional anchor when changing plans made the move feel uncertain.","She listened without taking the decision about the flat away from me.","Her support helped me see a manageable next step when I felt unsettled.","I could talk through the change with her instead of pretending I was completely certain."],"options":["She was an emotional anchor when changing plans made the move feel uncertain.","She listened without taking the decision about the flat away from me.","Her support helped me see a manageable next step when I felt unsettled.","I could talk through the change with her instead of pretending I was completely certain."]},"advanced-native-1296-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Delivering notes provides practical help, but calling the classmate an emotional anchor would need evidence of emotional steadiness as well."],"options":["The regular delivery already establishes that the person feels reassured by this classmate.","The account establishes that the person discusses her worries with the classmate during each delivery.","Delivering notes provides practical help, but calling the classmate an emotional anchor would need evidence of emotional steadiness as well."]},"advanced-native-1296-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["對方必須隨時替本人處理所有決定。"],"options":["上下文可交代支持如何發生。","有人或某事物提供情緒上的安穩。","對方必須隨時替本人處理所有決定。"]},"advanced-native-1296-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["She is an emotional anchor for me, but her listening helps me make the choice rather than handing it over."],"options":["I should follow whichever flat she mentions first so that she knows I value her help.","If I want to choose for myself, I should stop discussing the move with her at all.","She is an emotional anchor for me, but her listening helps me make the choice rather than handing it over."]},"advanced-native-1296-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["You have been an emotional anchor during this exhibition, listening when I struggled to put my worries into words. I am grateful for that support, alongside the help others gave, and I want you to have time for your own work next month.","Thank you for being an emotional anchor while I prepared the exhibition; your listening mattered, even though you were not the only person helping. Please do not feel that this thanks is a request to put your own project aside."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1298', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1298-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Both people contribute in different ways without treating help as an exact debt."],"options":["The same person provides all the help while the other refuses any involvement.","They exchange identical tasks and check that each takes exactly the same time.","Dad chooses every photograph while the speaker gives all the recipe lessons.","Both people contribute in different ways without treating help as an exact debt."]},"advanced-native-1298-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The help goes from Dad to me and from me to Dad, even though the tasks differ.","Neither person is only a receiver in the arrangement we described.","It works both ways: Dad shares cooking skills, and I offer help with his photographs.","Each of us contributes something the other finds useful."],"options":["The help goes from Dad to me and from me to Dad, even though the tasks differ.","Neither person is only a receiver in the arrangement we described.","It works both ways: Dad shares cooking skills, and I offer help with his photographs.","Each of us contributes something the other finds useful."]},"advanced-native-1298-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The listening expectation works both ways here, applying to the reader as well as the writer."],"options":["Only the writer is expected to listen before answering.","Both people must agree with each other’s interpretation before either can speak.","The listening expectation works both ways here, applying to the reader as well as the writer."]},"advanced-native-1298-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["雙方每次必須付出完全相同的時間。"],"options":["雙方每次必須付出完全相同的時間。","可以進一步說明兩邊各作了甚麼。","支持或要求在兩個方向都適用。"]},"advanced-native-1298-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It can work both ways without matching task for task; we each offer something the other values."],"options":["We should stop the useful help until we can find two tasks that take exactly the same time.","I should describe Dad as the only person giving help, because our skills are different.","It can work both ways without matching task for task; we each offer something the other values."]},"advanced-native-1298-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want our support to work both ways, and I am grateful for your help with the interview. This week I can read two pages carefully; could you choose the part where my response would be most useful?","Support works both ways, but I do not want to repay your kindness with a promise I cannot keep. I can give two pages a thoughtful reading now, and you can decide whether that fits what you need."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1299', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1299-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["A connection with family values, without a compulsory future occupation."],"options":["A connection with family values, without a compulsory future occupation.","A confirmed shop-opening plan that the speaker had already accepted.","A new legal name that had to appear on every document.","A reason to reject repairing things because the family had never valued it."]},"advanced-native-1299-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The stories made a family practice part of how I understood myself, without choosing my career for me.","They gave me a sense of identity by connecting our family’s repair practices with its history.","I could understand the history behind something our family valued.","Her account helped me understand why certain values felt familiar to me."],"options":["The stories made a family practice part of how I understood myself, without choosing my career for me.","They gave me a sense of identity by connecting our family’s repair practices with its history.","I could understand the history behind something our family valued.","Her account helped me understand why certain values felt familiar to me."]},"advanced-native-1299-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Checking the address establishes a delivery detail, not by itself a sense of identity in this personal meaning."],"options":["Checking the address establishes a delivery detail, not by itself a sense of identity in this personal meaning.","The correct address shows that she feels she belongs to the new neighbourhood.","The account says she has reflected on how the move changed her values."]},"advanced-native-1299-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["她之後的所有選擇都已被固定。"],"options":["她之後的所有選擇都已被固定。","上下文可以交代這份認同的來源。","某段經驗幫助她理解自己。"]},"advanced-native-1299-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The stories gave me a sense of identity, but they did not make my career decision for me."],"options":["The stories gave me a sense of identity, but they did not make my career decision for me.","I should say the stories meant nothing unless I choose exactly the same work.","I have already accepted a shop job, because feeling connected is the same as agreeing to one."]},"advanced-native-1299-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["My paintings give me a sense of identity that includes where I came from and what I notice now. The old houses and the people waiting for buses belong in the same exhibition, without making either place my whole story.","A sense of identity is growing as I paint both remembered homes and unfamiliar faces in the city. I am not trying to speak for every person from one place; I am showing how my own attention has changed."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1300', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1300-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Continuing attention to each other’s lives despite distance and fewer calls."],"options":["Daily visits that continued after they moved into the same building.","An agreement that neither person would ever change their preferred routine.","One person kept all the old messages but had stopped listening to the other.","Continuing attention to each other’s lives despite distance and fewer calls."]},"advanced-native-1300-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She returned to details I had shared rather than treating the conversation as a formality.","The distance had changed our routine without removing the care we showed.","The bond was still there in the way we remembered and asked about each other’s lives.","Our calls were less frequent, but both people still paid attention."],"options":["She returned to details I had shared rather than treating the conversation as a formality.","The distance had changed our routine without removing the care we showed.","The bond was still there in the way we remembered and asked about each other’s lives.","Our calls were less frequent, but both people still paid attention."]},"advanced-native-1300-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The bond is still there, but their care does not mean the living arrangement has been agreed."],"options":["The bond is still there, but their care does not mean the living arrangement has been agreed.","Their greetings confirm that they have accepted the same plan for sharing a home.","Because the living plan is unresolved, neither person has offered any help."]},"advanced-native-1300-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有合作安排都必須照舊，不能另選。"],"options":["先前情境可能已有值得比較的改變。","所有合作安排都必須照舊，不能另選。","某種連繫持續存在。"]},"advanced-native-1300-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The bond is still there in how we listen to each other, even though the old calling routine has changed."],"options":["We should ignore the care in those conversations and judge only the number of calls.","The bond is still there in how we listen to each other, even though the old calling routine has changed.","I would promise a call every night to prove that nothing in our lives has changed."]},"advanced-native-1300-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The bond was still there as he closed the damaged case with care and she promised to hear his first solo performance. Their shared tour had ended, but neither gesture asked them to abandon the different music they wanted to make.","They would no longer tour together, yet the bond was still there in the carefully packed case and the promise to listen. The last lights went out on their shared stage, not on every form of care between them."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
