('advanced-native-1304', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1304-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They remembered a difficult family situation and offered a thoughtful form of contact."],"options":["They had resumed daily rehearsals at the speaker’s home.","They sent recordings without knowing anything about the father’s illness.","They agreed to stop communicating until everyone could visit in person.","They remembered a difficult family situation and offered a thoughtful form of contact."]},"advanced-native-1304-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their response to my father’s illness made me feel remembered.","The contact was less frequent, but it still felt personal and supportive.","The emotional thread still runs deep; their recordings showed that they remembered what my family was facing.","They found a caring way to stay in touch when I could not visit."],"options":["Their response to my father’s illness made me feel remembered.","The contact was less frequent, but it still felt personal and supportive.","The emotional thread still runs deep; their recordings showed that they remembered what my family was facing.","They found a caring way to stay in touch when I could not visit."]},"advanced-native-1304-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A warm first meeting may begin a connection, but does not by itself show that the emotional thread still runs deep across time."],"options":["The account describes two people who avoided conversation and found nothing they wanted to share.","A warm first meeting may begin a connection, but does not by itself show that the emotional thread still runs deep across time.","They renewed a long-standing connection after years of being apart."]},"advanced-native-1304-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["其中一人每次來電，另一人都必定能即時接聽。"],"options":["彼此仍有強烈的情感連繫。","其中一人每次來電，另一人都必定能即時接聽。","這種連繫可以在生活安排改變後延續。"]},"advanced-native-1304-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The emotional thread still runs deep; sending those recordings was thei