('advanced-native-1305', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1305-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She handled all the organising, while the others attended without preparing it."],"options":["She handled all the organising, while the others attended without preparing it.","She introduced the event after other members had arranged it.","She booked the room while another member contacted the readers.","She watched the event but had no part in its preparation."]},"advanced-native-1305-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The others attended as an audience rather than helping to arrange it.","She carried the whole burden, from booking the room to handling changes.","No other member had taken responsibility for any part of the preparation.","Every organising task mentioned was left to her."],"options":["The others attended as an audience rather than helping to arrange it.","She carried the whole burden, from booking the room to handling changes.","No other member had taken responsibility for any part of the preparation.","Every organising task mentioned was left to her."]},"advanced-native-1305-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker made an important contribution, but did not carry the whole burden of preparing the exhibition."],"options":["The speaker arranged the exhibition without any preparation by the other two students.","The labels and artwork were prepared only after the opening speech.","The speaker made an important contribution, but did not carry the whole burden of preparing the exhibition."]},"advanced-native-1305-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["She carried the whole burden."],"options":["She was responsible for that part of the preparation.","She made an important contribution.","She carried the whole burden."]},"advanced-native-1305-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["They attended, but Mina carried the whole burden of organising; watching did not share the preparation."],"options":["They attended, but Mina carried the whole burden of organising; watching did not share the preparation.","I would count being in the audience as taking responsibility for the room booking.","I thought the readers had arranged their own invitations without Mina’s help."]},"advanced-native-1305-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The host deserves our thanks, but he did not carry the whole burden of the sale. Could we also name the students who checked the donations and arranged transport?","Rather than say the host carried the whole burden, I would thank him for presenting and acknowledge the donation checks and transport work separately. That would recognise everyone’s contribution without taking away his credit."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
