('advanced-native-1315', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1315-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They share parts of everyday life while keeping separate homes."],"options":["They all sleep in one flat but describe its rooms as separate homes.","They have separate flats and have stopped making any shared arrangements.","The phrase means they have agreed that anyone may enter any flat at any time.","They share parts of everyday life while keeping separate homes."]},"advanced-native-1315-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They keep their own homes while agreeing on meals and practical support.","Their shared routines depend on agreement rather than one shared address.","They are living together while living apart, sharing some meals and planning help in advance.","Their separate flats do not prevent them from sharing parts of the week."],"options":["They keep their own homes while agreeing on meals and practical support.","Their shared routines depend on agreement rather than one shared address.","They are living together while living apart, sharing some meals and planning help in advance.","Their separate flats do not prevent them from sharing parts of the week."]},"advanced-native-1315-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Nearby homes and a shared workplace do not yet show what living together while living apart would mean in their personal lives."],"options":["Nearby homes and a shared workplace do not yet show what living together while living apart would mean in their personal lives.","I would use the shared workplace as sufficient evidence that they already share their family routines outside work.","The nearby addresses tell us which private responsibilities the two relatives have agreed to share."]},"advanced-native-1315-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["分住附近單位，卻完全未了解是否有共同生活或聯絡。"],"options":["分住不同住所，但雙方同意定期聚餐及互相幫忙。","分住附近單位，卻完全未了解是否有共同生活或聯絡。","各自保留私人空間，同時協商日常分工。"]},"advanced-native-1315-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Living together while living