('advanced-native-1316', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1316-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She stopped assuming one sequence suited everyone and offered several possible routes."],"options":["She replaced the old sequence with one compulsory route designed around caring responsibilities for all students.","She removed job and housing decisions from the advice rather than offering alternative ways to approach them.","She stopped assuming one sequence suited everyone and offered several possible routes.","She required caring students to postpone all decisions until they could follow the original order."]},"advanced-native-1316-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She questioned whether the same order of milestones suited every student.","She began allowing for caring duties and different practical routes.","She replaced a single expected sequence with more flexible advice.","She reconsidered the idea that adulthood should follow one simple script."],"options":["She questioned whether the same order of milestones suited every student.","She began allowing for caring duties and different practical routes.","She replaced a single expected sequence with more flexible advice.","She reconsidered the idea that adulthood should follow one simple script."]},"advanced-native-1316-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their lives need not follow one simple script; the display should show more than one route into study."],"options":["The display establishes that every mature student has already left work.","The purpose is to give every visitor an identical timetable after enrolment.","Their lives need not follow one simple script; the display should show more than one route into study."]},"advanced-native-1316-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["活動表格讓參加者選兼讀、全日制或暫不決定，並解釋各項需要。"],"options":["宣傳把偏離單一路徑的人一概描寫成失敗。","諮詢者未了解個人情況，就只准對方選同一人生次序。","活動表格讓參加者選兼讀、全日制或暫不決定，並解釋各項需要。"]},"advanced-native-1316-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Avoiding one simple script does not mean wi