('advanced-native-1318', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1318-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["One person controls the editorial decisions even though others help with proofreading."],"options":["One person controls the editorial decisions even though others help with proofreading.","Ren personally performs every task without any help from other members.","All members can approve final wording independently.","Ren delegated topic choices to the members and kept control only of final punctuation."]},"advanced-native-1318-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The group has helpers while keeping decisions in one person’s hands.","It is a one-man show because Ren retains the final say over all content.","Proofreading is shared, but editorial approval stays with Ren.","Other members can suggest changes without having authority to approve them."],"options":["The group has helpers while keeping decisions in one person’s hands.","It is a one-man show because Ren retains the final say over all content.","Proofreading is shared, but editorial approval stays with Ren.","Other members can suggest changes without having authority to approve them."]},"advanced-native-1318-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may still be a one-man show in decision-making, even with several people helping to carry out the plans."],"options":["It may still be a one-man show in decision-making, even with several people helping to carry out the plans.","Five names on the list show that each volunteer has equal authority over spending.","The description says that no volunteer has performed any work."]},"advanced-native-1318-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["各人可在已商量的範圍內自行決定，超出範圍才一起討論。"],"options":["同一人要求所有小改動也須由自己批准。","各人可在已商量的範圍內自行決定，超出範圍才一起討論。","大家只負責執行，所有方向都由一人定下。"]},"advanced-native-1318-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We can avoid a one-man show by sharing defined decisions, while still agreeing on who approves spending beyond the budget."],"options":["We can avoid a one-man show b