('advanced-native-1325', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1325-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her reliable support matters, and her need for rest is still respected."],"options":["Being central means she makes every household decision alone.","The description concerns the exact place where she sits in the house.","Her reliable support matters, and her need for rest is still respected.","She has agreed to listen at any hour without asking for a break."]},"advanced-native-1325-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her careful listening gives us somewhere to begin a difficult conversation.","She helps us feel supported without having to be available every evening.","We value her reliability and respect the quiet time she requests.","She is the steady centre of our home, offering dependable support while keeping time to rest."],"options":["Her careful listening gives us somewhere to begin a difficult conversation.","She helps us feel supported without having to be available every evening.","We value her reliability and respect the quiet time she requests.","She is the steady centre of our home, offering dependable support while keeping time to rest."]},"advanced-native-1325-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Time spent at home does not by itself establish that he is the steady centre of the home; we need to know how he supports or relates to the family."],"options":["His remote-working hours are enough to identify him as the person who provides the family’s dependable support.","I would infer that he now coordinates the family’s daily needs from the change to home working.","Time spent at home does not by itself establish that he is the steady centre of the home; we need to know how he supports or relates to the family."]},"advanced-native-1325-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["放棄自己的休息，隨時處理所有人的困難。"],"options":["謝謝他提供過的具體支持。","放棄自己的休息，隨時處理所有人的困難。","在他願意時，一起商量日常需要。"]},"advanced-native-1325-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["She has been the steady centre of t