('advanced-native-1330', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1330-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They accepted the real delay and gathered other relevant information about the day."],"options":["They used later visitors’ comments to record the opening as punctual.","They checked the log but decided no visitor’s experience was relevant.","They accepted the real delay and gathered other relevant information about the day.","They rejected the complaint solely because one visitor could not describe the whole day."]},"advanced-native-1330-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The opening problem did not tell us what visitors experienced later.","Different times could reveal relevant parts that one complaint did not cover.","We wanted to recognise the delay without making it the only fact in the account.","We needed to understand the whole picture rather than treat one period as the entire fair."],"options":["The opening problem did not tell us what visitors experienced later.","Different times could reveal relevant parts that one complaint did not cover.","We wanted to recognise the delay without making it the only fact in the account.","We needed to understand the whole picture rather than treat one period as the entire fair."]},"advanced-native-1330-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Another comment may help, but it does not establish the whole picture while relevant timing and conflicting accounts remain unexplored."],"options":["The account says the editor has compared the timing of all the visitors’ reports.","Another comment may help, but it does not establish the whole picture while relevant timing and conflicting accounts remain unexplored.","The positive comment settles the earlier delay because favourable and unfavourable views cancel each other out."]},"advanced-native-1330-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有相關資料確實都已核對，沒有任何遺漏。"],"options":["可以詢問說話者所指的範圍及依據。","說話者認為自己已理解完整情況。","所有相關資料確實都已核對，沒有任何遺漏。"]},"advanced-native-1330-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We can seek the whole picture while keeping the delay in the account; more context should not erase a checked fact."],"options":["I took one true complaint as enough to explain the whole day’s experience.","We can seek the whole picture while keeping the delay in the account; more context should not erase a checked fact.","I thought the later praise answered the complaint about the opening, so no separate check of that complaint was needed."]},"advanced-native-1330-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I judged you before I had the whole picture, and I am sorry for saying you did not care. I now know you had explained your absence, and I should ask about what I still do not understand rather than speak for your feelings.","I did not have the whole picture when I described your short reply as indifference. I withdraw that judgement; knowing about your earlier message gives me a reason to listen, not to claim I understand every part of your day."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1331', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1331-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Irritable replies affected the new actor, even though the speaker was also worried about props."],"options":["The speaker had found the props and apologised before any irritated reply.","Irritable replies affected the new actor, even though the speaker was also worried about props.","The sighs were a calm way of inviting the actor to ask more questions.","The new actor had already agreed not to ask any questions at rehearsal."]},"advanced-native-1331-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I was short-tempered, and my irritated replies made asking for help harder.","The actor needed usable answers rather than a sigh in response to a simple question.","My worry about the props did not remove the effect of my tone.","I wanted to recognise how I responded, not place the responsibility for that response on the new actor."],"options":["I was short-tempered, and my irritated replies made asking for help harder.","The actor needed usable answers rather than a sigh in response to a simple question.","My worry about the props did not remove the effect of my tone.","I wanted to recognise how I responded, not place the responsibility for that response on the new actor."]},"advanced-native-1331-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A brief answer alone does not establish that she is short-tempered; the described tone is calm and open to questions."],"options":["A brief answer alone does not establish that she is short-tempered; the described tone is calm and open to questions.","The short answer confirms that she becomes angry whenever anyone asks for directions.","The account says she refused to give any directions or hear another question."]},"advanced-native-1331-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["那個下午的反應，足以證明他平常也一直對人不耐煩。"],"options":["那個下午，他容易動怒或不耐煩。","那個下午的反應，足以證明他平常也一直對人不耐煩。","更多資料可以指出他怎樣回覆別人。"]},"advanced-native-1331-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I was short-tempered, and the worry does not make those replies fair; I want to apologise and answer the questions properly."],"options":["I was short-tempered, and the worry does not make those replies fair; I want to apologise and answer the questions properly.","I would ask the new actor to stop checking anything until all the props are found.","I should explain the missing props first and leave my tone out of the discussion."]},"advanced-native-1331-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I am becoming short-tempered, and I do not want visitors to face rushed answers. Could we agree a ten-minute handover so I can sort the unanswered questions before returning to the desk?","I am becoming short-tempered at the desk, so I would like a brief handover before I answer the next visitor. If you can cover ten minutes, I will use that time to order the unanswered questions; please tell me if you need a different arrangement."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1332', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1332-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker felt able to express disappointment, although the result remained painful."],"options":["The speaker felt able to express disappointment, although the result remained painful.","The friend persuaded the speaker to describe the result as a success immediately.","The conversation changed the audition decision and secured a place.","The speaker hid the disappointment because the friend wanted a quick lesson."]},"advanced-native-1332-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["There was room for my actual feelings, not only an acceptable positive response.","It offered emotional shelter because I could speak about the disappointment without hiding it.","My friend listened without demanding that I find a lesson immediately.","I could admit that the result still hurt instead of pretending I was fine."],"options":["There was room for my actual feelings, not only an acceptable positive response.","It offered emotional shelter because I could speak about the disappointment without hiding it.","My friend listened without demanding that I find a lesson immediately.","I could admit that the result still hurt instead of pretending I was fine."]},"advanced-native-1332-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The account establishes physical shelter from the rain, but not by itself emotional shelter."],"options":["The account establishes physical shelter from the rain, but not by itself emotional shelter.","Staying dry establishes that the passengers felt able to share personal worries with the staff.","The account explicitly describes a reassuring conversation between staff and passengers."]},"advanced-native-1332-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["所有引起難過的實際問題都已解決。"],"options":["所有引起難過的實際問題都已解決。","可以進一步說明哪些互動令人安心。","那次談話帶來被照顧或情緒較安全的感受。"]},"advanced-native-1332-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It gave me emotional shelter without changing the result; being able to speak honestly mattered to me."],"options":["It gave me emotional shelter without changing the result; being able to speak honestly mattered to me.","I thought emotional support should involve immediate advice about what I ought to do next.","I thought still feeling sad meant I had not accepted the support."]},"advanced-native-1332-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We hope this group can offer emotional shelter, whether you read a piece or simply listen today. Please ask permission before sharing anyone’s personal story outside the group.","You are welcome to listen without reading aloud; emotional shelter includes having a choice about what you share. Let us keep personal stories within the group unless the writer agrees otherwise."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1333', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1333-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["By allowing complete questions and giving an explanation in manageable steps."],"options":["By asking them to stop questioning and copy a finished arrangement without explanation.","By treating hesitation as a decision not to volunteer.","By asking experienced volunteers to take over before the newcomers could finish speaking.","By allowing complete questions and giving an explanation in manageable steps."]},"advanced-native-1333-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Their hesitation did not tell me that they were unwilling to help.","Hearing the whole question helped me choose which step to explain next.","I wanted not to snap or rush them while they were learning the sorting routine.","They needed an explanation, and interrupting would have hidden what they did not understand."],"options":["Their hesitation did not tell me that they were unwilling to help.","Hearing the whole question helped me choose which step to explain next.","I wanted not to snap or rush them while they were learning the sorting routine.","They needed an explanation, and interrupting would have hidden what they did not understand."]},"advanced-native-1333-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He can state the boarding deadline and still choose not to snap or rush them as they ask for directions."],"options":["He can state the boarding deadline and still choose not to snap or rush them as they ask for directions.","Mentioning the deadline establishes that he spoke angrily to the passengers.","His brief statement shows that he refused to hear which entrance the passengers needed."]},"advanced-native-1333-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["She snapped them."],"options":["She rushed them.","She snapped them.","She snapped at them."]},"advanced-native-1333-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I can choose not to snap or rush them and still explain the finishing time calmly, then agree what can wait